ription\n- Reuse the saved proof of `nonencodingMarginalMass_le` at its identical\n  supplied-`GlobalPairWitness` statement; add only its existing support import.\n- Mark the existing chapter-16 node as a proved *auxiliary* supplied-witness\n  estimate. The main source-facing construction already obtains its witness\n  and uses separate proved estimates; it does not call this theorem.\n- Update the two stale decoding gap-status statements and restore the dated\n  issue-517 audit with original proof provenance and failed-PR-CI history.\n\n### Testing\n- Current-head CI passed all nine contexts in 308 seconds on `57da4a91`.\n  Blueprint rendering ran; LDT statement-origin was skipped by the changed-path rules.\n- The rooted blueprint axiom audit passed 1661 declarations with zero failures\n  and three existing statement-level warnings.\n- Independent bounded integration review5244004306 approved this head with no\n  findings, preserving the first full review5240952565 and F1 recheck5241533460.\n  It verified identical changed-content bytes and the surrounding source/blueprint\n  integration; it did not repeat the unchanged mathematical proof audit.\n- Retained author checks include focused Lean, the targeted Consistency build,\n  fresh axiom queries, blueprint rendering/synchronization and normal hooks.\n  The unrelated open absorption theorem remains recorded with `sorryAx`.\n\n---\nAddresses #517\n", "created_at": "2026-09-17T19:32:33Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T03:49:53Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "20ae50e4b4514202eb0842c1822ef50098100b45", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milest